[engl]
{100}{}{Aradesh}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{Begin, no quests done}
{1020}{}{Radscorpions done.}
{1030}{}{Radscorpions in progress}
{1040}{}{Begin Tandi Quest}
{1050}{}{Tandi quest in progress}
{1060}{}{Tandi rescue completed}
{2000}{}{Greetings, wanderer. Please do not be offended if the gentlefolk about seem rude. As Dharma said, 'Tough times tan the human hide.' Your business in Shady Sands might be?@@Greetings. Your business in Shady Sands might be?@@We don't take to strangers much. Your business in Shady Sands?}
{2010}{}{I'm from a small village west of here. I'm just exploring and mean you no harm.}
{2020}{}{What's it to you?}
{2030}{}{My reasons are mine to keep.}
{2040}{}{I'm from a Vault to the west. My people are dying of thirst and I need to find a water
purifier chip for them to survive.}
{2050}{}{I'm from a Vault to the west. My people are dying of thirst and I need to find a water purifier chip for them to survive.}
{2060}{}{I'm saving an entire people from destruction!}
{2070}{}{Shady Sands? Whoops, I'm lost! I'll just be going now.}
{2080}{}{Hunh?}
{3000}{}{I know of no village to the west.}
{3010}{}{So?}
{3020}{}{Have you been through the mountains west of here?}
{3030}{}{Are you saying you know every location from here to the ocean?}
{3040}{}{I'm sure you've been many places, but you must have missed my tiny village.}
{4000}{}{Thank goodness you came! I am in desperate need of assistance. My daughter, Tandi, is missing. I do not know what to do!}
{4010}{}{Uhh?}
{4020}{}{Have you tried to save her?}
{5000}{}{And keep them you may. But this is not a city of open hospitality. If you desire that,
go to Junktown. You may enter, but know we have our eyes on you.}
{5010}{}{[Done.]}
{6000}{}{Yes, hmmm, yes, yes. yes. I shall believe you...for now. But we do not trust easily, especially those who might be dangerous. Know that Seth and I will be watching you.}
{6010}{}{[Done.]}
{7000}{}{Certainly. What do you wish to know?@@You may ask, but please hurry. There are more important uses for my time.}
{7010}{}{Thanks. Bye.}
{7020}{}{What can you tell me about the other towns around here?}
{7030}{}{What's going on around here?}
{7040}{}{What's going on around here?}
{7050}{}{What's going on around here?}
{7060}{}{What's going on around here?}
{8000}{}{So be it, wanderer. Seth will show you out.}
{8010}{}{[Done.]}
{9000}{}{Hmmm. You may enter. But stay out of trouble.}
{9010}{}{[Done.]}
{10000}{}{Dharma said, 'Heed not the call of the wolf when the fox is raiding the hen house.'
Junktown lies south of here, though there is little in the way of visitation. From stories, I'm certain there are cities south of that.}
{10010}{}{Thanks. I . . . Can I ask you a few more questions?}
{11000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh16_2']}
{11010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh31]}
{11020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh30a]}
{11030}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh35]}
{11040}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh28]}
{11050}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh26]}
{12000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh39b']}
{12010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> UpReact]}
{12020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh40]}
{13000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh02_5']}
{13010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh09]}
{13020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh04]}
{14000}{}{Things are much more settled now. Razlo has been working on a cure for Rad Scorpion
poison, and with that, we should be able to fight what's left of them.}
{14010}{}{It was nothing. Can I ask you some more questions?}
{14020}{}{You don't need to worry anymore. I destroyed the Nest.}
{15000}{}{Please hurry and rid us of those Rad Scorpions!}
{15010}{}{[Done.]}
{16000}{}{Since you brought my Tandi back to me, things are quite fine. My eternal gratitude to
you, wanderer.}
{16010}{}{What can you tell me about the other towns around here?}
{16020}{}{What's going on around here?}
{16030}{}{Thanks. Bye.}
{17000}{}{Oh my yes. Great packs of Rad Scorpions are killing our herds. We don't know where
they're from, and no matter how many we kill, there's always more!}
{17010}{}{Go on.}
{18000}{}{It is a quiet time, thankfully.}
{18010}{}{Well, then, can I ask you a few more questions?}
{18020}{}{Good. Hopefully it will stay that way for a while.}
{18030}{}{Sounds . . . boring}
{19000}{}{It is my town, wanderer. You must answer my questions or leave. This is not a matter of choice.}
{19010}{}{Don't worry, I'm leaving.}
{19020}{}{I don't have to tell you anything.}
{19030}{}{I mean you no harm, really.}
{20000}{}{I will not waste my time on treacherous outsiders.
---
I certainly hope so.}
{20010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh39]}
{20020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh39]}
{20030}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh37]}
{20040}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh37]}
{20050}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh46]}
{20060}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh43]}
{20070}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh31]}
{20080}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh30a]}
{20090}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh35]}
{20100}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh18]}
{20110}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh17]}
{20120}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh01]}
{21000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'UpReact']}
{21010}{}{[Done.]}
{22000}{}{If you can understand me, please try to find my daughter.}
{22010}{}{[Done.]}
{23000}{}{My people are not skilled in this. Already three patrols have gone out to look, but none returned. Will you help me?}
{23010}{}{Okay. Who could have taken her?}
{23020}{}{I'll do it . . . for a fee.}
{23030}{}{I am sorry, but I have other things I have to do.}
{24000}{}{Seth and I believe one of the raider clans is responsible - retribution for our
resistance to them. Take this spear. It was found where my daughter was last seen.}
{24010}{}{Okay, I'll check it out.}
{25000}{}{Please, talk to Seth. He knows much about these raiders. And God speed, wanderer.}
{25010}{}{[Done.]}
{26000}{}{Of course, I will reward you. Bring her and you will receive 500 in Hub Script. Will you
help me?}
{26010}{}{Okay. Who could have taken her?}
{26020}{}{Ah . . . no thanks. I got other stuff I gotta take care of.}
{27000}{}{As Dharma said, 'While you are out hunting the wolves, do not bring the lion to your
den.' If you will not help, you must leave here.}
{27010}{}{[Done.]}
{28000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh39c']}
{28010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh42]}
{29000}{}{Ahh, wanderer. How goes the search for my daughter?}
{29010}{}{Slow, but I am making some progress. Can I ask you a few more questions?}
{29020}{}{Sorry, but I haven't found her. I will, though.}
{29030}{}{Guunngggg!}
{29040}{}{I'm sorry, but she is dead.}
{29050}{}{Duh-nada.}
{30000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh24c']}
{30010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradeshx]}
{30020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh44]}
{31000}{}{Until we meet again, my friend. May the water you find in the desert not shine at you in the dark.}
{31010}{}{[Done.]}
{32000}{}{You are truly a hero! Know that the people of Shady Sands are most grateful.}
{32010}{}{Thanks. Can I ask you a few more questions, though?}
{32020}{}{Thanks. Bye!}
{33000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh17_2']}
{33010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh44]}
{33020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh20]}
{34000}{}{Ah. Happy journeys, wanderer.}
{34010}{}{[Done.]}
{35000}{}{And now the monsters are attacking my people! Razlo is trying to find a cure for their poison, but I'm not sure how it goes.}
{35010}{}{Well, I'll help you get rid of these things!}
{35020}{}{I can help you for a price.}
{35030}{}{That's terrible. Can I ask you a few more questions?}
{36000}{}{Ummm, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes! Please talk to Razlo. He possesses far more information
on these creatures than I.}
{36010}{}{[Done.]}
{37000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh28b']}
{37010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh30]}
{38000}{}{As Dharma said, 'Those who tend their own flock, know the shepherd.'}
{38010}{}{Your choice. Can I ask you some more questions?}
{38020}{}{I know it's hard for you to trust, but I would like to help.}
{39000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh30b']}
{39010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> UpReact]}
{39020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh29]}
{40000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh28c']}
{40010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh19]}
{41000}{}{Yes. We like it that way.}
{41010}{}{Thanks. Bye.}
{41020}{}{What can you tell me about the other towns around here?}
{41030}{}{What's going on around here?}
{42000}{}{May my thoughts be wings to your feet. Please hurry.}
{42010}{}{[Done.]}
{43000}{}{Thank you for trying. Please leave me to my grief.}
{43010}{}{[Done.]}
{44000}{}{That is not yours. Please do not take it.}
{44010}{}{[Done.]}
{45000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'BigDownReact']}
{45010}{}{[Done.]}
{46000}{}{I will be forever in your debt for your courage and bravery, wanderer. Here is your reward.}
{46010}{}{Thanks. Can I ask you a few more questions, first?}
{46020}{}{Thanks.}
{46030}{}{[Done.]}
{47000}{}{Greetings. What may I help you with this fine day?@@
Is there something you want?}
{47010}{}{I was wondering if I could ask you a few questions?}
{47020}{}{Nuh-uh.}
{47030}{}{Nothing, really, I was just leaving.}
{47040}{}{Can you tell me about Shady Sands?}
{48000}{}{Yes, yes. Umm. Have a good stay.}
{48010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradeshx]}
{49000}{}{Shady Sands is much like a family, one that keeps to itself.@@We are a very protective community. As Dharma said, 'Many sticks can be broken. A bundle
cannot.'}
{49010}{}{Interesting. Are there any other cities around here?}
{49020}{}{How cute. Well, I better be going.}
{49030}{}{What kind of things do you have around here?}
{50000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh23_2']}
{50010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh24]}
{50020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh24b]}
{51000}{}{The Gardens are on the south side. The Brahma Pens are north, although the smell is, I fear, quite intense this time of year.}
{51010}{}{Anything else?}
{52000}{}{We are small and self sufficient so there is little else to tell.}
{52010}{}{Thanks. Can I ask you a few more questions?}
{52020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}
{53000}{}{It is a small place. You have feet.}
{53010}{}{Thanks. Can I ask you a few more questions?}
{54000}{}{Greetings again, young wanderer. I hope your stay here has been pleasant.}
{54010}{}{It's been great. Can I ask you some questions?}
{54020}{}{Nuh-huh.}
{54030}{}{It has. I gotta run though.}
{54040}{}{If you like sewers.}
{55000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh17_3']}
{55010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh27]}
{55020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh27]}
{55030}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh21]}
{55040}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh22]}
{56000}{}{Dharma said, 'A man and his wayward tongue are soon parted.' Come back when you have
learned some manners.}
{56010}{}{[Done.]}
{57000}{}{That is quite enough, wanderer. Seth will show you out of the city. Do not return. Your welcome will not be pleasant.}
{57010}{}{[Done.]}
{58000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh02_4']}
{58010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh06]}
{58020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh09]}
{59000}{}{You are quite insolent. I believe you should leave. Do not return. You will not be welcome.}
{59010}{}{[Done.]}
{60000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh02_2']}
{60010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh03]}
{60020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh08]}
{61000}{}{Ah well, to my regret, I have not. Which begs the question, how did you make that passage?}
{61010}{}{What's it to you?}
{61020}{}{Look, all I wanted was a few supplies and things, but I will gladly go elsewhere.}
{61030}{}{I don't need to answer you.}
{61040}{}{It was pretty tough, but I made it.}
{62000}{}{You must think me quite gullible, wanderer. You conquered the mountains by yourself?}
{62010}{}{Doesn't matter how I think. It's true I came from the mountains.}
{62020}{}{No, just stupid.}
{63000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh08a']}
{63010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh04]}
{63020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> UpReact]}
{64000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh08b']}
{64010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh06]}
{65000}{}{As Dharma said, 'Caution is life in troubled times.' Your origin is not the issue. Your intent is.}
{65010}{}{Okay.}
{66000}{}{I will let you pass, but know this: Seth and I will watch you very, very closely. Do not
even consider bringing trouble here.}
{66010}{}{[Done.]}
{67000}{}{Wanderer, I shall believe you . . . for now. You may enter Shady Sands, but be warned your every move will be watched.}
{67010}{}{I was wondering if I could ask you a few questions?}
{67020}{}{Thanks. Bye.}
{67030}{}{Nuh-huh.}
{68000}{}{A Vault. How shall I trust you, wanderer, when you are not honest with me?}
{68010}{}{No, honestly, I come from a Vault!}
{68020}{}{The Vault is . . . the name of my village.}
{68030}{}{You're right, I was lying.}
{69000}{}{Hmmm, yes, yes, yes. Then tell me of this Vault.}
{69010}{}{Well . . . the Vault is actually the name of my town. We name it that because it's in
between two big cliffs.}
{69020}{}{Why do you want to know?}
{69030}{}{It's a big place built into a mountain far to the west. My people have been there for
the last 80 years.}
{70000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh11a']}
{70010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh02]}
{70020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh14]}
{71000}{}{I will not be lied to, wanderer.}
{71010}{}{Don't worry, I'm leaving.}
{71020}{}{I don't have to tell you anything.}
{71030}{}{I mean you no harm, really.}
{72000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'aradesh11b']}
{72010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> aradesh14]}

